#: templates/dashboard/participant_detail.html:136
msgid ""
"This is typically a virtualized/bridged uplink with an internal loop re-"
"transmitting frames it receives but doesn't own; it usually appears after a "
"fabric flap and clears on its own. It's benign (not spoofing), but it adds "
"needless broadcast load — disabling the loop (bridge loop-protection / non-"
"reflecting mode) stops it."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente es un uplink virtualizado o en bridge con un bucle interno que "
"retransmite tramas que recibe pero no le pertenecen; suele aparecer tras un "
"flap del fabric y se resuelve solo. Es benigno (no es spoofing), pero añade "
"carga de broadcast innecesaria — desactivar el bucle (protección de bucle "
"del bridge / modo no reflectante) lo detiene."

