#: templates/dashboard/route_server_parity.html:12
msgid "Route-Server Parity"
msgstr "Paridad de servidores de rutas"

#: templates/dashboard/route_server_parity.html:14
msgid ""
"SFMIX runs two route servers (BIRD and OpenBGPD) for redundancy, and peering"
" with both is required so that a single route-server failure never cuts a "
"network off. Networks that are not established on both servers — or whose "
"received-prefix counts disagree — are listed first."
msgstr ""
"SFMIX opera dos servidores de rutas (BIRD y OpenBGPD) para redundancia, y el"
" peering con ambos es obligatorio para que el fallo de un solo servidor de "
"rutas nunca deje aislada a una red. Las redes que no están establecidas en "
"ambos servidores —o cuyos recuentos de prefijos recibidos no coinciden— se "
"enumeran primero."

